WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.340
Boy, as views go, that one's not bad. Good morning, Hank. It's Friday.

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:05.669
And I'm in Bellingham, Washington at a literature conference

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:08.820
So Hank, over the weekend, there's going to be a Question Tuesday video not on Tuesday.

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:10.960
Nerdfighters pleased to be leaving your questions and comments.

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:12.420
But today Hank,

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:14.660
I want to ask you a question.

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:16.920
I was walking backwards.

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:19.580
Hank, we've been making videos back and forth for more than three years

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:23.380
and in all that time we have never once discussed Red Green.

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:24.980
And I'm starting to wonder

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:27.060
whether maybe that's because

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.000
you are guilty of a terrible crime.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.460
Now, Hank, the preface to this story is that when I was a kid,

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:32.620
I had a best friend,

00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:34.420
Nintendo Entertainment System.

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:36.680
Nintendo and I went to everywhere together,

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:38.550
which is to say that I never left the house.

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:40.800
Hank, there was nothing in life that made me happier

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:42.960
than when I would press that NES power button

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:45.060
and hear those fateful words

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:47.420
[Nintendo]: "BLADES OF STEEL"

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:49.100
Still sends a shiver down my spine.

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:50.520
And of course, we also had a dog,

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:52.880
a miniature dachshund named Red Green,

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:54.060
who hated me.

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:55.020
By the way, Hank, if you're wondering

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:57.620
I'm on my way to a bookstore to try to secretly sign some of my books.

00:00:57.620 --> 00:00:58.860
Now Hank, as you probably remember,

00:00:58.860 --> 00:01:01.980
the original Nintendo Entertainment System had a plastic flap

00:01:01.980 --> 00:01:05.300
which you opened and then removed a game cartridge or put one in.

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:07.020
And sometimes, at the end of a long day of playing

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:10.280
Zelda and Mario and Double Dribble and Blades Of Steel,

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:12.140
I would remove that last game cartridge

00:01:12.140 --> 00:01:14.760
and because I was not as good a friend to Nintendo

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:16.300
as Nintendo was to me,

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:18.460
I would leave that plastic flap open.

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:19.040
Now Hank,

00:01:19.049 --> 00:01:22.720
There can be no question, that in his life, Red Green did many terrible things.

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:24.280
He enjoyed biting children.

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:26.640
He would pee on my bedroom carpet

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:28.540
while staring me in the eyes.

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:29.680
Oh look I'm a Staff Pick!

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:34.360
But Hank, in our family, Red Green is most famous for what I discovered one summer morning,

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:35.260
when I woke up,

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:36.780
dragged myself to the living room

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:38.549
and went to go play Nintendo.

00:01:38.549 --> 00:01:39.702
You see, Hank,

00:01:39.702 --> 00:01:40.680
Red Green

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:41.720
had pooped

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:43.060
in my best friend,

00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:44.440
the Nintendo.

00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:47.200
I don't mean he pooped ON the Nintendo.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:49.400
I mean, he pooped IN the Nintendo.

00:01:49.409 --> 00:01:51.440
I had left the plastic flap open overnight,

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:53.398
and when I went to put Blades Of Steel in the machine,

00:01:53.399 --> 00:01:54.900
I discovered red poop,

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:57.160
Well the poop wasn't actually red, it was brown,

00:01:57.160 --> 00:01:58.439
but it was from Red.

00:01:58.439 --> 00:02:01.660
Now Hank, the list of suspects for the crime is really limited to our nuclear family

00:02:01.660 --> 00:02:02.760
and Red himself

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:05.080
because it happened overnight and the doors were locked.

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:06.800
Now, I know I didn't do it

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:10.180
because I loved that Nintendo more than I loved my own...

00:02:10.180 --> 00:02:11.200
I'll just say it,

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:11.700
brother.

00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:12.900
Mom or Dad is certainly a possibility

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:14.380
but I think they like the Nintendo,

00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:16.240
it minimized the amount of time I was annoying them.

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:18.560
Plus it's just hard to imagine either of our parents

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:19.940
picking up dog poop

00:02:19.940 --> 00:02:22.000
and inserting it into a Nintendo.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:23.900
Inexplicable gazeboooo.

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:26.680
So, far as I can tell, this leaves two possibilities:

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:27.220
One:

00:02:27.220 --> 00:02:28.680
you put the poop in the Nintendo,

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:29.320
or two:

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:32.760
in the middle of the night, Red Green awoke in a fit of violent jealousy,

00:02:32.770 --> 00:02:34.780
backed up to the Nintendo,

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:36.780
placing his bum against its opening,

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:38.060
and proceeded to

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:40.320
projectile poop into the Nintendo.

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:41.140
Unfortunately Hank,

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:44.220
because I know just how nefarious a dog Red Green was,

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:46.300
I cannot discount that possibility.

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:47.650
This means if we were playing Clue,

00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:49.720
I would know the murder weapon and the location,

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:51.060
--it was Red Green's poop

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:51.909
in the Nintendo--

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:54.960
but, even after all these years, I still do not know the murderer.

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:55.460
Hank,

00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:58.320
I think enough time has passed for you to answer the question honestly.

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:00.430
Did you put Red Green's poop in the Nintendo?

00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:03.340
Or was Red Green some kind of pooping genius?

00:03:03.340 --> 00:03:05.780
Hank, I expect your answer on Monday.

